{"identidad_confirmada": true, "pruebas_identidad": [{"url": "https://musicbrainz.org/recording/d7d38cfa-df06-451f-a80d-a71cde08675f", "cita": "I Want to Break Free / Cómo librarme de ti ~ Recording by Ketama | 1.10 Cómo librarme de tí 3:00 Ketama Tributo a Queen Various Artists Album US 1997-10-21 Hollywood Records (a label of Disney Music Group) 162059 | 1.10 I Want to Break Free / Cómo librarme de ti 3:00 Ketama Tributo a Queen: Los grandes del rock en español Various Artists Album MX 1997 Hollywood Records (a label of Disney Music Group) HR 161701-2 | Artist: Ketama"}, {"url": "https://musicbrainz.org/artist/7fe8e911-d706-44d9-b633-702065f8fd6c", "cita": "Ketama (Spanish new flamenco group) ... Type: Group Area: Spain"}], "pais": {"valor": "España", "url": "https://musicbrainz.org/artist/7fe8e911-d706-44d9-b633-702065f8fd6c", "cita": "Area: Spain"}, "ciudad": {"valor": "Madrid", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ketama_(band)", "cita": "Ketama formed in Madrid in the early eighties, taking its name from a well-known valley in Morocco."}, "año_formacion": null, "generos": [{"genero": "New flamenco", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ketama_(band)", "cita": "Origin Madrid, Spain Genre New flamenco Years active 1984–2004"}, {"genero": "Flamenco fusión", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ketama_(band)", "cita": "Ketama is a Spanish musical group in the new flamenco tradition. Fusing flamenco with other musical forms (salsa, Brazilian music, reggae, funk, jazz), they created a style that lies somewhere between flamenco and pop salsa."}, {"genero": "alternative folk, flamenco", "url": "https://musicbrainz.org/artist/7fe8e911-d706-44d9-b633-702065f8fd6c", "cita": "Tags Genres alternative folk, flamenco"}], "datos_para_biografia": [{"dato": "El cover «I Want to Break Free / Cómo librarme de ti» lo grabaron para el recopilatorio Tributo a Queen: Los grandes del rock en español (1997) y también apareció en su álbum Sabor Ketama (España, 1998, PolyGram Ibérica).", "url": "https://musicbrainz.org/recording/d7d38cfa-df06-451f-a80d-a71cde08675f", "cita": "1.7 I Want to Break Free / Cómo librarme de ti 2:59 Ketama Sabor Ketama Ketama Album ES 1998 PolyGram Ibérica, S.A. (not a label but a Spanish record company distributing labels like Polydor, A&M, Mercury etc.) 536150-2"}, {"dato": "Formación inicial de tres guitarristas/cantantes procedentes de dinastías flamencas gitanas.", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ketama_(band)", "cita": "The initial line-up featured José Soto Sorderita (guitar), Juan Carmona (guitar) and Ray Heredia (vocals). Each of the three came from flamenco dynasties: the Heredias of Madrid, the Habichuelas of Granada and the Carmonas of Jerez."}, {"dato": "Alcanzaron reconocimiento internacional con el disco Songhai, junto a Danny Thompson y el korista maliense Toumani Diabaté.", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ketama_(band)", "cita": "They earned international recognition with their third record, Songhai, a fusion of flamenco with Danny Thompson and Toumani Diabaté's African kora, which was praised in reviews in The Times and The International Herald Tribune."}]}
